{"seq":2,"slug":"ssh-fleet-scale-automation","title":"大规模机群配置管理、证书分发与密钥轮换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ssh-bastion-privileged-access-engineering/zero-trust-scale-ops/ssh-fleet-scale-automation","wordCount":2859,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"大规模机群配置管理-证书分发与密钥轮换\">大规模机群配置管理、证书分发与密钥轮换</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一台主机的 SSH 加固是一个配置问题；三千台主机的 SSH 加固是一个<strong>收敛问题</strong>。差别不在数量，而在失败模式的种类：单机时你只需要问「配置对不对」，规模化后必须先问「<strong>你怎么知道每一台现在还是对的</strong>」。凭据所依赖的信任材料（CA 公钥、主机密钥、撤销列表）如何抵达每一台机器，以及更换这些材料时如何不制造大范围登录失败，是本节的问题。</p>\n<p>必须把三样东西的轮换节奏分开，混在一起是规模化运维的头号错误。**主机密钥（host key）**变更会改变所有客户端 <code>known_hosts</code> 的信任判断，只在重装或发现泄露时做。**CA 信任集（<code>TrustedUserCAKeys</code> / <code>TrustedHostKeys</code>）**变更只影响服务端校验证书时接受的签名者集合，每 1–2 年一次。<strong>用户证书</strong>由 <a href=\"../ssh-ca-keyless-access/certificate-issuance-rotation\">证书签发、短生命周期与轮换自动化</a> 那套链路自动续签。三者节奏的差异决定工具分工：<strong>能通过一次 API 调用解决的问题不要写进配置管理，需要落到每一台主机磁盘上的状态才走配置管理。</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信任材料</th>\n<th>变更频率</th>\n<th>分发方式</th>\n<th>单台失败的后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主机密钥</td>\n<td>极低（重装/泄露）</td>\n<td>配置管理 + <code>known_hosts</code> 同步</td>\n<td>客户端 MITM 告警或连不上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CA 信任集（<code>Trusted*CAKeys</code>）</td>\n<td>1–2 年（CA 轮换）</td>\n<td>配置管理全量下发</td>\n<td>该主机拒绝全部新证书</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>撤销列表（KRL）</td>\n<td>事件驱动</td>\n<td>配置管理或在线拉取</td>\n<td>已吊销凭据仍可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户证书</td>\n<td>分钟–小时</td>\n<td>签发服务按需签发</td>\n<td>该用户这次登录失败</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>规模化的核心成本不在「分发一次」，而在<strong>证明这次分发对每一台都成功了</strong>。NIST IR 7966 把 SSH 的配置错误归为「非交互式账户管理失控」的典型场景，强调必须能对全部主机给出可复核的状态，而不是抽查几台。〔<a href=\"https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/ir/7966/final\">NIST IR 7966</a>〕</p>\n<h2 id=\"分发层选型-谁把信任材料送到-n-台主机\">分发层选型：谁把信任材料送到 N 台主机</h2><p>2026 年在生产环境里并存的四种分发机制，本质差别是<strong>谁发起连接、信任锚是什么、失败是否被收集</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>发起方</th>\n<th>信任锚</th>\n<th>状态收敛</th>\n<th>适用规模</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Ansible / 配置管理推</td>\n<td>控制节点 → 主机</td>\n<td>控制节点凭据</td>\n<td>每次 play 报告每台结果</td>\n<td>数百–数万</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Agent 拉取（Salt / Puppet / Chef）</td>\n<td>主机 → 主控</td>\n<td>主控证书 + agent 证书</td>\n<td>持续收敛 + 定期上报</td>\n<td>数千–数十万</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>镜像烘焙（bake 进 AMI/容器）</td>\n<td>无（构建期）</td>\n<td>构建流水线</td>\n<td>只对新实例有效，存量需重建</td>\n<td>弹性实例池</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>在线拉取（<code>AuthorizedKeysCommand</code>）</td>\n<td>sshd → 内部服务</td>\n<td>服务 mTLS + 网络策略</td>\n<td>无本地状态，实时</td>\n<td>强动态场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>四个选择点，而不是一个「哪个最好」。<strong>推送模型的失败率在数千台规模下不可忽略</strong>：控制节点要在一次 play 内维持数千条并发连接，受文件描述符、<code>ControlMaster</code> 复用与网络抖动约束，因此要分片（<code>serial</code> 分批）、用 <code>forks</code> 控制并发，并把「连接失败」当作一等状态逐台列出。<strong>Agent 拉取把收敛责任放到主机侧</strong>：即使某台主机被人手工改过 <code>sshd_config</code>，下一次 agent 周期会把它拉回声明状态；代价是每台主机要运行一个以 root 常驻的进程，它本身成了新的攻击面。<strong>镜像烘焙与在线拉取代表两个极端</strong>：前者靠替换实例收敛，后者让 <code>AuthorizedKeysCommand</code> 每次登录实时查询；共同点是<strong>都消除了「主机上有一份需要轮换的静态文件」</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  SRC[&quot;信任材料源&lt;br/&gt;CA 公钥 / KRL / 主机密钥清单&quot;] --&gt; LAYER{&quot;分发层选型&quot;}&#10;  LAYER --&gt;|&quot;推送&quot;| PUSH[&quot;Ansible play&lt;br/&gt;分片 + forks&quot;]&#10;  LAYER --&gt;|&quot;拉取&quot;| PULL[&quot;Salt / Puppet&lt;br/&gt;持续收敛&quot;]&#10;  LAYER --&gt;|&quot;烘焙&quot;| BAKE[&quot;镜像流水线&lt;br/&gt;替换实例&quot;]&#10;  LAYER --&gt;|&quot;在线&quot;| ONLINE[&quot;AuthorizedKeysCommand&lt;br/&gt;实时查询&quot;]&#10;  PUSH --&gt; H[&quot;目标主机 sshd&quot;]&#10;  PULL --&gt; H&#10;  BAKE --&gt; H&#10;  ONLINE --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; VERIFY{&quot;每台确认?&quot;}&#10;  VERIFY --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| REPAIR[&quot;定向重试 / 重建&quot;]&#10;  VERIFY --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| DONE[&quot;可进入下一阶段&quot;]&#10;  REPAIR --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n  SRC[\"信任材料源&lt;br/&gt;CA 公钥 / KRL / 主机密钥清单\"] --&gt; LAYER{\"分发层选型\"}\n  LAYER --&gt;|\"推送\"| PUSH[\"Ansible play&lt;br/&gt;分片 + forks\"]\n  LAYER --&gt;|\"拉取\"| PULL[\"Salt / Puppet&lt;br/&gt;持续收敛\"]\n  LAYER --&gt;|\"烘焙\"| BAKE[\"镜像流水线&lt;br/&gt;替换实例\"]\n  LAYER --&gt;|\"在线\"| ONLINE[\"AuthorizedKeysCommand&lt;br/&gt;实时查询\"]\n  PUSH --&gt; H[\"目标主机 sshd\"]\n  PULL --&gt; H\n  BAKE --&gt; H\n  ONLINE --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; VERIFY{\"每台确认?\"}\n  VERIFY --&gt;|\"否\"| REPAIR[\"定向重试 / 重建\"]\n  VERIFY --&gt;|\"是\"| DONE[\"可进入下一阶段\"]\n  REPAIR --&gt; H</pre><p>图中 <code>VERIFY</code> 节点是整节要点：<strong>分发完成不等于轮换完成</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三层信任材料的轮换节奏不同\">三层信任材料的轮换节奏不同</h2><p>规模化轮换之所以难，是因为三层材料之间有依赖顺序，顺序错了就制造宕机。</p>\n<p><strong>顺序一：先铺新 CA 公钥，再签新证书。</strong> 主机侧信任集必须先接受新 CA，签发服务才能用新 CA 签证书；反过来做，第一批新证书到任何主机上都会被拒。<code>TrustedUserCAKeys</code> 指向的文件里要同时包含新旧两把公钥，每行一个并注释退役日期。</p>\n<p><strong>顺序二：先确认新证书全量可用，再移除旧 CA 公钥。</strong> 判据是旧 CA 签出的证书已全部过期或被替换。</p>\n<p><strong>顺序三：撤销列表只在需要时下发，但通道必须可靠。</strong> OpenSSH 支持基于 KRL（Key Revocation List）的吊销，用 <code>ssh-keygen -k</code> 从包含待吊销公钥/证书的文件生成 KRL，再由 <code>RevokedKeys</code>（用户）与 <code>RevokedHostKeys</code>（主机）指向它。〔<a href=\"https://man.openbsd.org/ssh-keygen.1\">ssh-keygen(1)</a>〕早于 10.3 的 OpenSSH 对这两个指令只允许单文件，<strong>10.3（2026-04-02）起允许指定多个文件</strong>〔<a href=\"https://www.openssh.org/releasenotes.html\">OpenSSH 发布说明</a>〕，使「多 CA 并行信任期 + 集中吊销列表」第一次能拆成两个独立文件管理。</p>\n<p>主机密钥这一层最需要克制，因为它<strong>变更即断裂</strong>：客户端 <code>known_hosts</code> 里记的是旧公钥，换了就得同步更新，且必须覆盖所有会连它的客户端（CI 机器人、其他主机、监控系统）。判断标准很简单：<strong>除非怀疑私钥泄露或主机重装，否则不换</strong>。放进配置管理时应采取「存在即保持、缺失才生成」的幂等策略，绝不每次重生成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"双-ca-重叠窗口-轮换期的可用性算术\">双 CA 重叠窗口：轮换期的可用性算术</h2><p>轮换期必然存在一个<strong>新旧并存的窗口</strong>，窗口长度的下界由三个量决定：证书 TTL、分发传播时间、时钟偏移容忍。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>overlap</mtext></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>TTL</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>propagate</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mtext>skew</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{overlap}} \\ge T_{\\text{TTL}} + T_{\\text{propagate}} + \\delta_{\\text{skew}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">overlap</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">TTL</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">propagate</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">skew</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>TTL</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{TTL}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">TTL</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是最长可能仍在用的旧 CA 签出证书的剩余寿命（短生命周期证书就是 TTL 本身）；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>propagate</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{propagate}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">propagate</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是新 CA 公钥铺满全部主机、且新证书开始被接受所需的时间；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mtext>skew</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta_{\\text{skew}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">skew</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是主机间时钟偏移容忍量——<code>valid after</code> / <code>valid before</code> 是绝对时间，某台主机时钟快了几分钟就可能提前把一张有效证书判为过期。代入具体数字：轮值证书 TTL 8 小时（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>TTL</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mtext>h</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{TTL}}=8\\text{h}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">TTL</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">h</span></span></span></span></span></span>）、全量分发含重试约 40 分钟（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>propagate</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.67</mn><mtext>h</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{propagate}} \\approx 0.67\\text{h}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">propagate</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.67</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">h</span></span></span></span></span></span>）、时钟偏移容忍 15 分钟（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mtext>skew</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.25</mn><mtext>h</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta_{\\text{skew}} = 0.25\\text{h}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">skew</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.25</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">h</span></span></span></span></span></span>），窗口下界约 <strong>8.9 小时</strong>，通常按「跨一个工作日」来排。<strong><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>TTL</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T\\_{\\text{TTL}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TTL</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是主导项</strong>：缩短 TTL 会线性和缩短轮换窗口，但会提高签发链路的调用量与可用性要求。常见错误是只算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>propagate</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{propagate}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">propagate</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，忽略仍在使用中的旧证书。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>轮换阶段</th>\n<th>主机侧状态</th>\n<th>签发侧状态</th>\n<th>退出判据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1. 铺新公钥</td>\n<td>信任集 = {旧, 新}</td>\n<td>仍用旧 CA 签</td>\n<td>全量主机确认含新公钥</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2. 切签发</td>\n<td>信任集 = {旧, 新}</td>\n<td>改用新 CA 签</td>\n<td>新证书首次登录成功</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3. 等待过期</td>\n<td>信任集 = {旧, 新}</td>\n<td>只用新 CA</td>\n<td>旧证书全部过期（≥ TTL）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4. 删旧公钥</td>\n<td>信任集 = {新}</td>\n<td>只用新 CA</td>\n<td>全量确认且无登录失败</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第四步最容易出事：若有任何一台主机上的旧证书还没过期，或有客户端缓存了旧 CA 信任，删旧公钥会立刻表现为「某些人进不去了」。因此删公钥前必须<strong>主动探测</strong>——用一把故意由旧 CA 签发、已过期的证书去连接，确认主机都拒绝它。</p>\n<h2 id=\"漂移检测-把-应该是什么-变成可审计的差异\">漂移检测：把「应该是什么」变成可审计的差异</h2><p>配置管理提供的「已部署」并不等于「现在仍然正确」：主机可能被人手工改过、被其他自动化覆盖、或被上一个失败 play 半途修改。第二个支柱是<strong>持续把实际状态与声明状态比对</strong>。</p>\n<p>可核验的事实有几类，都能在无交互条件下采集。<code>sshd -T</code> 打印 sshd 生效后的完整配置（含所有 <code>Include</code> 与默认值展开），是判断「实际生效值」的权威来源。〔<a href=\"https://man.openbsd.org/sshd_config\">sshd_config(5)</a>〕<code>ssh-keygen -l -f &lt;pubkey&gt;</code> 给出公钥指纹与算法，可核对信任集里每把公钥是否与清单一致。<code>ssh-keyscan</code> 抓取主机自称的主机公钥与清单比对——但它本身不验证信任，只用于发现「自称的值变了」。</p>\n<p>最小闭环是：每次配置管理运行后，采集每台主机的 <code>TrustedUserCAKeys</code> 指纹集合、<code>RevokedKeys</code> 文件的哈希、<code>sshd -T</code> 的关键指令值，与上一版本做差集，非空即报警。</p>\n<p>需要与同 hub 的 <a href=\"../ssh-protocol-security-model/ssh-hardening-host-key-algorithms\">服务端加固、主机密钥校验与算法博弈</a> 划清边界：那边讨论单台主机上算法与校验策略本身应该怎么配，这里讨论<strong>如何证明这几千台配的东西是一致的</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"零信任收敛-从静态分发走向按需签发\">零信任收敛：从静态分发走向按需签发</h2><p>配置管理分发静态信任材料的模型，在零信任接入下会遇到结构性张力：<strong>每台主机上留存的静态材料越多，能长期冒用的凭据就越多</strong>。零信任方向的做法是把「主机上有什么」尽可能换成「主机上线时能换到什么」。</p>\n<p>三个收敛形态在 2026 年已是主流。**工作负载身份（SPIFFE/SPIRE 一类）**给每个工作负载签发短生命周期身份文档，取代静态密钥作为互相认证的锚。**会话代理（session broker）**把授权判断从主机移到代理层：用户连代理、代理按策略决定能否到达目标，主机上只需信任代理的签名者——<a href=\"../bastion-jump-architecture/jump-host-session-broker-forwarding\">jump-host 会话代理</a> 讨论的通道模型构成承载层。**在线授权查询（<code>AuthorizedKeysCommand</code>）**让 sshd 每次登录实时问内部服务，本地不缓存授权。</p>\n<p>三者的共同后果是<strong>分发层的作用变了</strong>：它不再分发「授权」，而只分发自举（bootstrap）所需的信任锚——即「如何确认签发服务是可信的」这一条根。这把规模化的风险面压缩到了最小，也解释了为什么在成熟环境里配置管理对 SSH 的部分越来越薄。代价是<strong>可用性依赖前移</strong>：签发或授权服务一旦不可用，全部登录受影响，因此降级路径必须显式设计。短 TTL 证书在有效期内可离线使用，所以降级不是「放行任意登录」，而是让已签发证书在 TTL 内继续有效，同时允许运维用受控的离线应急凭据——这条路径须被审计、有到期时间、用过即告警。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>规模化 SSH 运维的本质是把「信任材料的一致性」变成可证明的事实：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>分开三种节奏</strong>：主机密钥（重装/泄露才换）、CA 信任集（1–2 年）、用户证书（分钟–小时）分属不同变更通道，混做一次必然出事故。</li>\n<li><strong>分发层按「谁发起、信任锚是什么、失败是否被收集」选型</strong>，而不是按工具流行度。</li>\n<li><strong>轮换窗口用公式排期</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>overlap</mtext></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>TTL</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>propagate</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mtext>skew</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{overlap}} \\ge T_{\\text{TTL}} + T_{\\text{propagate}} + \\delta_{\\text{skew}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">overlap</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">TTL</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">propagate</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">skew</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，TTL 是主导项。</li>\n<li><strong>四步顺序不可颠倒</strong>：铺新公钥 → 切签发 → 等旧证书全过期 → 删旧公钥；删公钥前用一张过期旧证书主动探测。</li>\n<li><strong>把「已部署」与「仍正确」分开</strong>：用 <code>sshd -T</code>、公钥指纹集合与 KRL 哈希做持续漂移检测。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大规模机群配置管理、证书分发与密钥轮换","id":"大规模机群配置管理-证书分发与密钥轮换"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"分发层选型：谁把信任材料送到 N 台主机","id":"分发层选型-谁把信任材料送到-n-台主机"},{"level":2,"text":"三层信任材料的轮换节奏不同","id":"三层信任材料的轮换节奏不同"},{"level":2,"text":"双 CA 重叠窗口：轮换期的可用性算术","id":"双-ca-重叠窗口-轮换期的可用性算术"},{"level":2,"text":"漂移检测：把「应该是什么」变成可审计的差异","id":"漂移检测-把-应该是什么-变成可审计的差异"},{"level":2,"text":"零信任收敛：从静态分发走向按需签发","id":"零信任收敛-从静态分发走向按需签发"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"零信任 SSH 接入模型与身份感知代理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ssh-bastion-privileged-access-engineering/zero-trust-scale-ops/zero-trust-ssh-access-model"},"next":{"title":"访问治理度量、异常检测与合规审计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ssh-bastion-privileged-access-engineering/zero-trust-scale-ops/ssh-access-incident-compliance"}}